---
layout: ds-layout.njk
title: 總覽
description: FANDOR 官網 Design System — 設計師可在此預覽 token 與元件，並對照 Figma 規格。
page:
  id: overview
---
{% from "ds-sync.njk" import renderOverviewSync %}

{{ renderOverviewSync() }}

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">快速開始</h2>
  <div class="ds-card-grid ds-card-grid--2">
    <a href="/design-system/tokens/" class="ds-card ds-card--link">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined ds-card__icon">palette</span>
      <h3 class="ds-card__title">Design Tokens</h3>
      <p class="ds-card__desc">色票、字級、間距、圓角、動效。由 <code>design-tokens/</code> 自動產生 CSS。</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/design-system/components/" class="ds-card ds-card--link">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined ds-card__icon">widgets</span>
      <h3 class="ds-card__title">Components</h3>
      <p class="ds-card__desc">{{ components.components.length }} 個元件，含 variant 預覽與使用頁面對照。</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">設計師工作流程</h2>
  <ol class="ds-steps">
    <li>在 <strong>Figma</strong> 調整 Variables（色票、字級等）</li>
    <li>用 <strong>Tokens Studio</strong> 匯出至 <code>design-tokens/</code> 並 commit</li>
    <li>執行 <code>npm run tokens:build</code>（或 <code>npm run build</code>）</li>
    <li>在 <a href="/design-system/tokens/">Design Tokens</a> 頁確認變更</li>
    <li>文案 / 首頁區塊 → 編輯 <code>content/</code> 後執行 <code>npm run build</code></li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">元件分類</h2>
  <div class="ds-category-list">
    {% for cat in components.categories %}
    <div class="ds-category">
      <h3 class="ds-category__title">{{ cat.label }}</h3>
      <p class="ds-category__desc">{{ cat.description }}</p>
      <ul class="ds-category__items">
        {% for comp in components.components %}
          {% if comp.category == cat.id %}
          <li><a href="/design-system/components/#{{ comp.id }}">{{ comp.name }}</a></li>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">目錄結構</h2>
  <pre class="ds-code"><code>design-tokens/          ← Figma Tokens Studio 匯入
css/m3-tokens.css       ← 自動產生（勿手改）
scripts/components-registry.json
design-system/          ← 此展示站</code></pre>
</section>
